# apps/.dockerignore — applies to any image whose build context is this
# pnpm workspace root (today: `docker build -f apps/web_admin/Dockerfile apps/`
# per HU-F13.7). Keeps the context small and out of the final image layers.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/build
**/out
**/.vite
**/.cache
**/coverage
**/.turbo

# Test tooling output — not needed to `vite build` the production bundle.
web_admin/e2e
web_admin/e2e-evidence
web_admin/playwright-report
web_admin/test-results
electron-sucursal/e2e
electron-sucursal/playwright-report
electron-sucursal/test-results

**/.git
**/.github
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Secrets — never let a stray local .env reach a build layer.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
